<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82563" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-χρίω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smear</i> or <i>cover over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλινόποδας σκορόδοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					17.3.11
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ὀδόντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.873
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ὑάλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Luct.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πρόσωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					5.102
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.77
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pour as unguent over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					7.14.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				14.175
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph.
			(cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίχρισμα</span>), prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.97
			</span></i> K. (
				Pass.
			).</div>
